  "summary": "C8 downloads the full 60x60 region for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 and the 2014 summer target and pickles it. C9 builds per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds from \u00b15-day pools around baseline dates, applies a 31-day wrap smoothing, and indexes the result at target days of year 153-244, which pulls in raw days 138-259 and pool dates May 12-Sep 20 of each baseline year. Hot runs are found on all 92 target days for every sea cell and the result is written to output/mhw_mask.nc; the climatology is not used."
